{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"paper-ink","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Paper and Ink","description":"Black ink on warm paper. Made for reading and writing prose.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Paper and Ink","path":"themes/paper-ink.json","uiTheme":"light"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/paper-ink.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Paper and Ink\",\n  \"type\": \"light\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#f7f4ee\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#2b2b2b\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#eeeae1\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#e6e1d6\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#e6e1d6\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#eeeae1\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#e3ded2\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#d9d2c0\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#fbf9f4\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#eeeae1\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#d8d2c4\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#b5481f\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#b5481f\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#b5481f\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#d9d2c0\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#e3ded280\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#b5481f\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#d8d2c4\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#b0302a\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#4a7a3d\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#9b5d1e\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#b0302a\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8b8678\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#4a7a3d\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9b5d1e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8b2e5a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#2d5f8a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b5481f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9b5d1e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#2d5f8a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8b2e5a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9b5d1e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#2d6f6a\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Paper and Ink\n\nBlack ink on warm paper. Made for reading and writing prose.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Paper and Ink** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a light theme.\n\nAn original palette by Vyloxi.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#f7f4ee` |\n| Text | `#2b2b2b` |\n| Accent | `#b5481f` |\n| Keywords | `#8b2e5a` |\n| Strings | `#4a7a3d` |\n| Functions | `#b5481f` |\n| Types | `#2d5f8a` |\n| Comments | `#8b8678` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}